---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "../../../components/common/Container.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="爱知县名古屋市 名古屋城天守阁｜锦乃｜WORKS"
  description=""
>


<section class="relative h-[920px] overflow-hidden bg-[#f5f1ea]">

  <!-- Background -->

  <picture>

    <!-- Smartphone -->
    <source
      media="(max-width: 768px)"
      srcset="/images/nagoyacastle-mobile.jpg"
    />

    <!-- PC -->
    <img
      src="/images/nagoya2.png"
      alt="名古屋城天守阁"
      class="work-hero absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover pointer-events-none select-none"
      draggable="false"
    />

  </picture>


  <!-- Content -->

  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-20 flex items-center">

    <Container>

      <div class="hero-content max-w-3xl">

        <!-- English -->

        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#f6e8c8]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          NAGOYA CASTLE MAIN TOWER
        </p>


        <!-- Title -->

        <h1
          class="mt-1 text-[48px] leading-[1.15] text-[#ffffff]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          名古屋城天守阁
        </h1>


        <!-- Subtitle -->

        <p
          class="mt-6 text-xl text-[#ffffff]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          金鯱闪耀的尾张名城。
        </p>


        <!-- Gold Divider -->

        <div class="mt-1">

          <img
            src="/images/gold-divider.png"
            alt=""
            class="w-[420px] h-auto select-none pointer-events-none"
            draggable="false"
          />

        </div>


        <!-- Summary -->

        <div class="mt-14 max-w-2xl">
        </div>

      </div>

    </Container>

  </div>


  <!-- Scroll -->

  <div class="absolute bottom-16 right-12 z-30 flex flex-col items-center">

    <div class="h-20 w-px bg-white/70"></div>

    <span class="mt-4 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-white">
      SCROLL
    </span>

  </div>

</section>



<section class="relative bg-[#f8f6f2] overflow-hidden works-detail">


  <!-- Washi Background -->

  <img
    src="/images/washi-bg.png"
    alt=""
    class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-full opacity-[0.3] pointer-events-none select-none -z-0"
  />


  <Container class="py-32 relative z-10">


    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">

        <span class="h-px w-24 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#9a8358]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          OVERVIEW
        </p>

      </div>


      <h2
        class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        作品概览
      </h2>


      <p
        class="mt-10 max-w-4xl text-base leading-10 text-[#55504a]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        建于爱知县名古屋市的近世城郭・名古屋城，是为防备丰臣方并作为统治西国的重要据点而修建的日式城郭，<br>
        并在整个江户时代与城下町一同繁荣发展。<br>
        庆长14年（1609年），在德川家康公的命令下开始筑城，并于庆长17年（1612年）竣工。<br>
        名古屋城拥有以金鯱为标志的壮丽大天守与小天守，是日本最具代表性的名城之一。
      </p>

    </div>


    <div class="mx-auto mt-20 max-w-6xl">
    </div>



    <div class="mx-auto mt-24 grid max-w-6xl gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_360px]">


      <!-- Left -->

      <div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

          <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#9a8358]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            HISTORY
          </p>

        </div>


        <h2
          class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          关于名古屋城・天守
        </h2>


        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base leading-10 text-[#4f4944]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >

          名古屋城天守是庆长14年（1609年）在德川家康公的命令下开始筑城，
          并于庆长17年（1612年）竣工的名古屋城象征性建筑。
          它作为防备丰臣方并统治西国的重要据点而修建，是一座近世城郭，
          此后作为德川御三家之首、尾张德川家的居城而繁荣发展。

          <br><br>

          天守为五重五阶、地下一层的连立式层塔型天守，
          大天守与小天守通过石垣和围墙相连接，形成壮大的整体构成。<br>
          屋顶上安置着象征名古屋城的金鯱，从破风、石垣、城门到瓦片等细节之中，都可以看到近世城郭建筑所展现的精湛技术。

          <br><br>

          明治时代，包含本丸御殿在内的许多建筑仍得以保存，
          但在昭和20年（1945年）的名古屋大空袭中，包括当时被指定为旧国宝的主要建筑在内，多座建筑不幸被烧毁。<br><br>

          此后，于昭和34年（1959年）以钢筋混凝土结构重建。<br>
          本丸御殿则以庆长时期的形制为基础进行复原，并于2018年完成全面复原与公开。<br><br>
<img
  src="/images/0804nagoya7.jpeg"
  alt="nagoya"
  class="nagoyacastle-image"
/>
<br><br>
          最新数据（令和7年度／2025年4月至2026年3月）显示，全年入场人数为：2,387,217人。<br>
          作为旅游名胜的同时，名古屋城也持续推进木造天守复原计划、天守阶梯体验馆以及二之丸区域的整备等工作，是一座正在积极推进复原与整备的城郭。

          <br><br>

          本作品以第二次世界大战后至今的名古屋城天守实物为制作对象，
          参考历史资料与现场调查，以我的世界日式建筑的形式将其立体化呈现。<br><br>

          天守内部则以「如果曾经存在的建筑在今天依然留存，会是什么样子」为设想，复原了其烧毁前的内部空间。
          对各层的构成、梁架、屋架等建筑结构也尽可能进行了考证，并以如同立体模型般真实的空间表现为目标进行制作。

        </p>

      </div>


      <!-- DATA -->

      <aside class="relative">

        <div
          class="rounded-[2rem] border border-[#e2d8cb] bg-[#fffdfa] p-10 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,.07)]"
        >

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#a68b64]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            DATA
          </p>


          <div class="mt-10 space-y-8">

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">作品名称</p>
              <p class="text-base">名古屋城天守</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">分类</p>
              <p class="text-base">日式城郭・天守阁</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">建造时期</p>
              <p class="text-base">江户时代初期</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">所在地</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                〒460-0031 爱知县名古屋市中区本丸一丁目1番
              </p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">筑城年份</p>
              <p class="text-base">庆长17年（1612年）</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">筑城者</p>
              <p class="text-base">德川家康公</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">形式</p>
              <p class="text-base">连立式层塔型天守阁</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">制作软件</p>
              <p class="text-base">我的世界 Java Edition</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">作品类型</p>
              <p class="text-base">日式建筑复原・再现</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">制作状态</p>
              <p class="text-base">完成</p>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>

      </aside>

    </div>


    <div class="mx-auto mt-32 max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

        <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          GALLERY
        </p>

      </div>


      <h2
        class="mt-6 text-4xl"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        展示照片
      </h2>


      <div class="gallery mt-12">

        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/nagoya.jpg"
            alt="名古屋城天守阁"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/nagoya1.png"
            alt="名古屋城天守阁"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/nagoya2.png"
            alt="名古屋城天守阁"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/nagoya3.png"
            alt="名古屋城天守阁"
          />
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>



    <div class="mt-24 flex flex-wrap gap-4">

      <a
        href="/zh-cn/works/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        ← 返回作品列表
      </a>


      <a
        href="https://www.planetminecraft.com/project/nagoya-castle-1-1-life-size-japanese-castle-aichi/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        查看更多 →
      </a>


      <a
        href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ovjqxyGvVoU"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        查看更多视频 →
      </a>



        <div class="mt-32 w-full text-center">

        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-5">

          <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            SHARE
          </p>

          <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        </div>


        <h2
          class="mt-6 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          分享作品
        </h2>


        <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-4 flex-wrap">


          <!-- X -->

          <a
            href="#"
            id="x-share"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            X
          </a>


          <!-- Instagram -->

          <button
            type="button"
            id="instagram-share"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            Instagram
          </button>


          <!-- Copy -->

          <button
            type="button"
            id="copy-url"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            复制URL
          </button>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </Container>

</section>


<script>

  const sharePhrases = [
    "找到这个了。",
    "这个莫名有点喜欢。",
    "看看这个。",
    "发现了个挺让人在意的东西。",
    "发现了这个。",
    "你知道这个吗？",
    "发现了个东西。",
    "原来还有这个。",
    "发现了个有点在意的东西。"
  ];


  const randomSharePhrase =
    sharePhrases[
      Math.floor(
        Math.random() * sharePhrases.length
      )
    ];


  const pageUrl =
    "https://www.nishikinolab.net/zh-cn/nagoyacastle/";


  const shareText =
    `${randomSharePhrase} Minecraft 名古屋城天守阁 | WORKS`;


  const xShareButton =
    document.getElementById("x-share");


  xShareButton?.setAttribute(
    "href",
    `https://x.com/intent/post?text=${encodeURIComponent(shareText)}&url=${encodeURIComponent(pageUrl)}`
  );


  const copyButton =
    document.getElementById("copy-url");


  const instagramButton =
    document.getElementById("instagram-share");



  copyButton?.addEventListener("click", async () => {

    try {

      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(pageUrl);


      if (copyButton) {

        copyButton.textContent = "已复制";


        setTimeout(() => {

          copyButton.textContent = "复制URL";

        }, 2000);

      }

    } catch (error) {

      console.error(error);

    }

  });


  instagramButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {

    const dialog =
      document.createElement("div");


    dialog.innerHTML = `

      <div
        id="instagram-share-overlay"
        style="
          position:fixed;
          inset:0;
          z-index:9999;
          display:flex;
          align-items:center;
          justify-content:center;
          padding:24px;
          background:rgba(43,39,36,.55);
          backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
        "
      >

        <div
          style="
            width:100%;
            max-width:420px;
            padding:36px;
            border:1px solid #e2d8cb;
            border-radius:28px;
            background:#fffdfa;
            box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
            text-align:center;
          "
        >

          <p
            style="
              margin:0;
              font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              letter-spacing:.35em;
              color:#a58c65;
            "
          >
            SHARE
          </p>


          <h3
            style="
              margin:14px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:24px;
              color:#2b2724;
              font-weight:400;
            "
          >
            在Instagram上分享
          </h3>


          <p
            style="
              margin:20px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              line-height:2;
              color:#625a52;
            "
          >
            复制此作品页面的URL后<br>
            打开Instagram。
          </p>


          <button
            id="instagram-open"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:28px;
              padding:14px 20px;
              border:1px solid #d7c8b3;
              border-radius:999px;
              background:#2b2724;
              color:#fff;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:15px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            复制URL并打开Instagram
          </button>


          <button
            id="instagram-cancel"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:10px;
              padding:12px 20px;
              border:0;
              background:transparent;
              color:#8c8378;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            取消
          </button>

        </div>

      </div>

    `;


    document.body.appendChild(dialog);


    const overlay =
      document.getElementById(
        "instagram-share-overlay"
      );


    const openButton =
      document.getElementById(
        "instagram-open"
      );


    const cancelButton =
      document.getElementById(
        "instagram-cancel"
      );


    openButton?.addEventListener(
      "click",
      async () => {

        try {

          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(
            pageUrl
          );

        } catch (error) {

          console.error(error);

        }


        window.open(
          "https://www.instagram.com/",
          "_blank",
          "noopener,noreferrer"
        );


        overlay?.remove();

      }
    );


    cancelButton?.addEventListener(
      "click",
      () => {

        overlay?.remove();

      }
    );


    overlay?.addEventListener(
      "click",
      (event) => {

        if (event.target === overlay) {

          overlay.remove();

        }

      }
    );

  });

</script>



<style>

.work-hero {

  animation:
    heroFloat 12s ease-in-out infinite;

  transform-origin:
    center;

}


@keyframes heroFloat {

  0% {

    transform:
      scale(1.03)
      translateY(0);

  }

  50% {

    transform:
      scale(1.06)
      translateY(-18px);

  }

  100% {

    transform:
      scale(1.03)
      translateY(0);

  }

}



.gallery {

  display:
    grid;

  grid-template-columns:
    repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));

  gap:
    1.5rem;

}


.gallery-frame {

  position:
    relative;

  padding:
    2px;

  border-radius:
    1.25rem;

  background:

    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.65) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.65) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.65) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );

  overflow:
    hidden;

}


.gallery-frame img {

  display:
    block;

  width:
    100%;

  height:
    auto;

  border-radius:
    calc(1.25rem - 2px);

  background:
    #f8f6f2;

}


.gallery-frame:hover {

  background:

    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.9) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.9) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.9) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );

}


section {

  position:
    relative;

}


section::before {

  content:
    "";

  position:
    absolute;

  left:
    0;

  top:
    0;

  width:
    100%;

  height:
    100%;

  pointer-events:
    none;

  background-image:

    radial-gradient(
      circle at 8% 10%,
      rgba(205,175,98,.08),
      transparent 18%
    ),

    radial-gradient(
      circle at 92% 82%,
      rgba(205,175,98,.06),
      transparent 22%
    );

}


aside {

  position:
    sticky;

  top:
    120px;

  height:
    max-content;

}


a {

  transition:
    .35s;

}


@media (max-width:1100px) {

  section {

    overflow:
      hidden;

  }



}



@media (max-width:768px) {

  section:first-child {

    height:
      760px;

  }


  h1 {

    font-size:
      44px !important;

    line-height:
      1.15;

  }


  h2 {

    font-size:
      32px !important;

  }


  .gallery-frame {

    border-radius:
      1rem;

  }


  .gallery-frame img {

    border-radius:
      calc(1rem - 2px);

  }

}

</style>

</Layout>